Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:51.70,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}霍达尔 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 布勃利克 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Rafa, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉法 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What a debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,好一场首秀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You must be incredibly happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一定非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and proud of that performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,也为这场表现骄傲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a pleasure, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to represent Team Europe for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次代表欧洲队出战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I felt great on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得在场上感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I played against a very tough player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是一个非常难缠的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think the atmosphere here is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这里的气氛太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you very much to all the people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢所有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that came.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,来看球的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been such a 12 months for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这12个月对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to watch the improvement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着你一路进步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and how dramatically you've risen up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,排名蹿升
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,the rankings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,有多快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Every time you come to an event,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你每去一个比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,it's a first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Explain what it's been like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说第一次来拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to come to the Laver Cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,a team event for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次打团体赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I come from different conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我来的地方条件完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to play from Davis Cup in clay, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚打完戴维斯杯的红土
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,在很远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I got the call, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我接到电话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,from Yannick that if I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,诺阿问我愿不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to represent team Europe and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,代表欧洲队 我当时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't think the two times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,想都没想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's great to be in an event
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,能来参加这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,where I can compete, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,和世界上最好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and be in the same team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在同一支队伍里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,with the best players in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's a pleasure for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以对我来说很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我非常感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,But tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过给我们讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,about how you think 12 months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,12个月前你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,did you ever dream of that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你梦到过这一刻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I imagine you wanted to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜你是想来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you think it would happen that quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想过会来得这么快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,no, I think it has come very fast to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有 我觉得一切来得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Many things, you know, in this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年很多事情都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think it's now at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得现在赛季快结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of the season time to process
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是时候好好消化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and analyze all the things
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,分析一下这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,because everything has come very fast
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为一切都来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,But at the same time, I'm very happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但同时我也很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, how the things are going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,事情的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm eager, you know, to keep improving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也很渴望继续进步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and be a better player next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,明年成为更好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,That's a problem for the rest of the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛其他人可要头疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,One thing though, you started
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过有件事 你曾经
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.52,EN,,0,0,0,,a very brief time in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在大学打过很短一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,you decided to turn pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后你决定转职业
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:45.28,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,事实证明这个决定是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But that period
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of being in college tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,打大学网球的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.44,EN,,0,0,0,,which is very competitive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,竞争很激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is it a lot like coming out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是很像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and playing in this environment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这种环境下打球？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a team event, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 这是团体赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so there are many similarities.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以有很多相似之处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that year at the in college really helped me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,大学那一年真的帮了我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, to be in this kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我能打这种比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of events playing with a team
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,和团队一起打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and for other players, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,为其他球员而打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,it's not just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是为你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,it's great to play in a team event,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能打团体赛太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in a team event for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次打团体赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,very very happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I know your team are very happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你的队友也很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,为你高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll let you get inside
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们让你回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:15.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and the way you play today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你今天这么打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I think there's going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得会有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to be plenty more Laver Cup towels
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多拉沃尔杯毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that you can put into your bag as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,装进你的包里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy, you know, to represent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴能代表欧洲队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah. I also want to thank Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想感谢费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,who was in the stands, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,他在看台上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,看我打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah. Thank you much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:35.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And also, yeah, it's a pleasure that he's
